# The temperature climbs a little more on every reading. The window reports warnings as soon as the
# trend is clear, and the threshold detector reports a critical once the value crosses its limit.
# Counts depend on how the trend meets the thresholds, so these expectations use lower bounds.
cycles 40
period_ms 100

at 1000 fault Drift

expect warning >= 35
expect critical >= 1
expect invalid == 0
